{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "直线 y = 2x + 1 中的斜率 2 是什么意思？",
    "goals": [
      "理解斜率表示当自变量 x 增加 1 时，因变量 y 增加的变化量",
      "掌握在坐标系中通过两点直观读出‘向右 1 步、向上 2 格’的几何意义"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "贯穿‘爬坡山路’的比喻，把水平移动与垂直上升对应到坐标变化",
        "通过点在直线上的移动演示，直观呈现 Δy / Δx 的比值关系"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": -2,
        "max": 3,
        "label": "点 A 的横坐标 x",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.025
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "把探险点的横坐标 x 移动到 -1，观察点的高度位置。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "向左滑动滑块，使 x 达到 -1",
          "代入公式：2 × (-1) + 1 = -1"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "做得很棒！找得非常准，当 x 变成 -1 时，高度 y 也是 -1！",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": -1,
          "tolerance": 0.0125
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "通过点沿直线运动，理解斜率 2 代表‘向右每走 1 个单位，高度就上升 2 个单位’",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "嗨！看到 y 等于 2x 加 1，我们直接把它想象成一段正在攀爬的山路！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "函数图像",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -2,
                    "max": 3,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 8,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((2)*(x))+(1)",
                    "label": "y = 2x + 1"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "moving-point",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 1,
                    "label": "P(x, y)"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.x",
                    "expression": "number_01"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "moving-point.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(number_01))+(1)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "y = 2x + 1"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "现在的山路上有一个探险点。当它的横坐标 x 是 0 时，y 的高度是 1。我们让它沿着山路往前走一步！",
          "delivery": "neutral",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "观察点在 x=0 时的初始位置",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "看，向右跨出了 1 步，也就是 x 增加了 1；山路的高度 y 立刻从 1 爬到了 3，足足上升了 2 格！",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 1,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-04",
          "say": "如果再向右走 1 步，从 1 走到 2 呢？高度又稳稳往上升了 2 格，来到了 5！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "animate",
              "variable": "number_01",
              "value": 2,
              "easing": "linear",
              "duration_intent": "normal",
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-05",
          "say": "这就是斜率 2 的真正含义：斜率表示坡度，也就是高度变化除以水平步数。向右走 1 步，高度必涨 2！",
          "delivery": "emphatic",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-05-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "斜率的含义",
                "items": [
                  "斜率 = 上升高度 ÷ 向右步数",
                  "x 每增加 1，y 对应增加 2"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-06",
          "say": "轮到你来体验这条山路了！请把探险点的横坐标 x 调整到负 1，看看此时对应的高度是多少！",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-05-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "继续观察当前画面",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "在直线 y = 2x + 1 中，斜率 2 表示直线的倾斜程度与变化率：x 每向右增加 1 个单位，y 就会稳定上升 2 个单位。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
